+++ b/web/src/app/fonts/README.md
@@ -1,10 +1,18 @@
-# IBM Plex Sans
+# Web fonts
 
-Original, unmodified IBM Plex Sans font files from [IBM/plex](https://github.com/IBM/plex/tree/763c36ef9117782905ae010056dfbe8fd2653a25). Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; see LICENSE.txt.
+Manual v4 §10 and §16.5: Public Sans is the one family on web (weights 400, 500, 600, 700). IBM Plex Mono is used only for machine strings such as skill tags and request IDs, never as a styling choice for small labels.
 
-The four weights match the existing design tokens. Local assets remove the Google Fonts build-time network dependency and the Windows Turbopack Google-font resolver failure.
+Both are bundled locally through `next/font/local`, so the build has no Google Fonts network dependency (this also avoids the Windows Turbopack Google-font resolver failure). The files are the unmodified Latin subsets published by Fontsource, version 5.3.0:
 
-- `IBMPlexSans-Regular.woff2`: SHA-256 `ba711a3085ff9f27440b6b9c4550cfc47c97bf36591d5da958b975bb3add8c1a`
-- `IBMPlexSans-Medium.woff2`: SHA-256 `5660f8a658f8bb50dbc005232f885eadffd2bc1c235c4f6fbb63469d1f9cde6d`
-- `IBMPlexSans-SemiBold.woff2`: SHA-256 `f78048030eab62e860efa39a0df79e2e5581bf122eb95b9bc42c0b8a4988d205`
-- `IBMPlexSans-Bold.woff2`: SHA-256 `fa7130d854a660b39a7fc9e6e0f2dc23dba5f1346e2adea3e1fe37b6d884133d`
+- `@fontsource/public-sans@5.3.0` from [uswds/public-sans](https://github.com/uswds/public-sans), SIL Open Font License 1.1, see `OFL-PublicSans.txt`.
+- `@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono@5.3.0` from [IBM/plex](https://github.com/IBM/plex), SIL Open Font License 1.1, see `OFL-IBMPlexMono.txt`.
+
+The Latin subset covers U+0000-00FF and General Punctuation (U+2000-206F), which includes every character the public copy uses.
+
+- `public-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2`: SHA-256 `36274b5787b4f03b27e65ae971d6c808a96838ccd60c9dabaee154889b6bba82`
+- `public-sans-latin-500-normal.woff2`: SHA-256 `55e866a00caa197bc9fafa52c907f4dfe88e51bbb3f585c777931d03eb961e96`
+- `public-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2`: SHA-256 `c7842f97346df1b3b470e9d71acde90f132dd858508ec5ae6606401e5d0938f7`
+- `public-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2`: SHA-256 `dace741613696827f61dbee2d984e8685f14a2846136783f3ad1c8950914bf1d`
+- `ibm-plex-mono-latin-400-normal.woff2`: SHA-256 `08949f728dc52d528e69b1667d15c89a5686a4ee9a296ff90983985f99c380f7`
+
+To reproduce: `npm pack @fontsource/public-sans@5.3.0 @fontsource/ibm-plex-mono@5.3.0`, extract, and copy the files above from each package's `files/` folder.
